# Copy to .env if needed. Nothing here is required — the site builds and runs
# with no .env file at all. See docs/environment.md.

# Public hCaptcha site key used by the component showcase demo.
# Leave unset to use hCaptcha's public test key (always validates).
# Site keys are public; never put an hCaptcha SECRET key in a VITE_ variable.
# VITE_HCAPTCHA_SITE_KEY=
